P1. The loader beside proot.

At start, proot takes the realpath of dladdr(main).dli_fname, the file that
holds its own code, and keeps it in proot_path. Every tracee runs through the
file PROOT_UNBUNDLE_LOADER names in that directory, whether the kernel ran
proot directly or through linker64. A 32-bit tracee gets ENOEXEC, since only
the native loader is built.

